Ported files and the siteproof files that contain the ports (siteproof paths relative to the skill folder):
  scripts/llms_txt_checker.py      -> scripts/checks/geo.mjs (scoreLlms, geo.llms-txt)
  scripts/robots_checker.py        -> scripts/checks/geo.mjs (parseRobots, rulesFor, isBlocked, geo.robots-ai)
  scripts/js_rendering_diff.py     -> scripts/checks/geo.mjs (geo.js-off-content)
  scripts/sitemap_validator.py     -> scripts/checks/seo.mjs, scripts/checks/lib.mjs (seo.sitemap, sitemapUrls)
  scripts/schema_graph_checker.py  -> scripts/checks/seo.mjs (seo.jsonld)
  scripts/broken_links_checker.py  -> scripts/checks/seo.mjs (seo.broken-links)
  scripts/images_audit.py          -> scripts/checks/seo.mjs (seo.img-alt)

Changes made by siteproof: rewritten in JavaScript for Node 20+; page fetching through Playwright
(JavaScript on and off) instead of requests/BeautifulSoup; results reduced to pass/fail per check ID
with per-page failure details; AI crawler list split into search crawlers (fail) and training crawlers
(reported only); robots matching supports * wildcards; URLs on the prod origin are mapped onto the
local preview origin; only internal links are probed; image checks limited to alt coverage.
